).jpg\"/></p><p>Over the past 20 years, JIADI Pumps Industry has grown to become an industry leader in water removing products, like bore hole pump, and serving customers in many industries related to the movement of water. We take pride in the professional skill and abundant experience in making pumps.</p><p><strong>1. Product Specification</strong></p><table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"table\" width=\"100%\"><tbody><tr class=\"firstRow\"><td width=\"166\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\">Item</p></td><td width=\"354\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\">Pump</p></td></tr><tr><td width=\"166\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\">Structure</p></td><td width=\"354\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\">Submersible screw pump</p></td></tr><tr><td width=\"166\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\">Motor Power Type</p></td><td width=\"354\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\">Electric</p></td></tr><tr><td width=\"166\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\">Body Material</p></td><td width=\"354\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\">Stainless Steel + Plastic</p></td></tr><tr><td width=\"166\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\">Brand Name</p></td><td width=\"354\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\">JIADI</p></td></tr><tr><td width=\"166\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\">Max. Head</p></td><td width=\"354\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\">80 m</p></td></tr><tr><td width=\"166\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\">Q Max.</p></td><td width=\"354\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\">2.5 m3/h</p></td></tr><tr><td width=\"166\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\">Motor Power</p></td><td width=\"354\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\">0.25-0.5KW/ 0.33-0.67HP</p></td></tr><tr><td width=\"166\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\">Max. Operating Temp.</p></td><td width=\"354\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\">35℃</p></td></tr><tr><td width=\"166\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\">Item Shape</p></td><td width=\"354\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\">Round</p></td></tr><tr><td width=\"166\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\">Max. Diameter</p></td><td width=\"354\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\">98/103 mm</p></td></tr><tr><td width=\"166\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\">Pump Length</p></td><td width=\"354\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\">527mm- 547mm in this series</p></td></tr><tr><td width=\"166\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\">Discharge Port</p></td><td width=\"354\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\">1&amp;rdquo;</p></td></tr><tr><td width=\"166\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\">Number of Wires</p></td><td width=\"354\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\">4</p></td></tr><tr><td width=\"166\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\">Warranty Description</p></td><td width=\"354\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\">1 year limited</p></td></tr></tbody></table><p><strong>2. Performance Curve</strong></p><p><br/></p><p><img src=\"/Content/upload/2018348866/201808271041534551948.jpg\" style=\"\" title=\"image005.jpg\"/></p><p><strong>3. Spare Parts</strong></p><p><img src=\"/Content/upload/2018348866/201808271041566710857.jpg\" style=\"\" title=\"image007.jpg\"/></p><p><strong>4. Company Profile</strong></p><p><br/></p><p><img src=\"/Content/upload/2018348866/201808271042541511415.jpg\" style=\"\" title=\"image009(001).jpg\"/></p><p>JIADI is always regarded as one of the best pump company in Taizhou, Zhejiang province. With over 20 years experience in making pumps, JIADI has the ability as well as the confidence in producing quality pumps. We overcome a lot of troubles, compete with strong rivals and finally have our own tactic in making pumps and serving customers. Just choose us and trust us, we will never let you down. </p><p><strong>5. Our Advantages</strong></p><p>Warmly Welcome:</p><p>1. We have the politest attitude to serve every customer</p><p>2. Never sell renewed pumps. Each pump is made through rigorous procedures and strict inspection.</p><p>3. Focus on middle and high-end market, we never seize market by using inferior material.</p><p>Satisfied Service </p><p>1. Quick response within 24 hours, solve problems in 2 days.</p><p>2. Visit our factory anytime, 24 hours phone call is available.</p><p>Reasonable Price </p><p>1. Factory direct sale, no more agency fee.</p><p>2. Aim at long-term cooperation, always offer our best price and best solution to customers.</p><p><strong>6. Package and Delivery</strong> </p><p>1. We will send your products by sea, by air or by express, which will depend on the quantity of your order as well as your requirements. Please tell us your request timely.  FOB, CIF and CFR (CNF) are the major trade terms.</p><p>2. The products will be packed in carton or plywood box, with or without plastic foam. Special requirements are acceptable, just tell our salesman timely. </p><p>3. Usually the lead time is within 20-30 days. If special circumstances happened, we will inform you promptly.</p><p><img src=\"/Content/upload/2018348866/201808271042584984951.jpg\" style=\"\" title=\"image011(001).jpg\"/></p><p><strong>7. Product Certification</strong></p><p><img src=\"/Content/upload/2018348866/201808241411154549302.jpg\" style=\"\" title=\"image013(001).jpg\"/></p><table><tbody><tr class=\"firstRow\"><td align=\"center\" style=\"\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"248\">ISO14001</td><td align=\"center\" style=\"\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"248\">OHSAS18001</td><td align=\"center\" style=\"\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"248\">CE </td></tr></tbody></table><p><img src=\"/Content/upload/2018348866/201808241411169751193.jpg\" style=\"\" title=\"image015(001).jpg\"/></p><p></p><table><tbody><tr class=\"firstRow\"><td align=\"center\" style=\"\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"248\">GS </td><td align=\"center\" style=\"\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"248\">ISO9001</td><td align=\"center\" style=\"\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"248\">RoHS</td></tr></tbody></table><p>We have those certificates to attest the quality of our pumps and reassure our customers. We stick to the principle “quality-oriented”, which is one of the reason why we are chosen by so many customers.</p><p><strong>8. FAQ</strong></p><p><strong>1. Q: Do you have a catalogue? Can you send me the catalogue to have a check of all your products?</strong></p><p>A: Yes, for getting catalog please contact us online or send us an Email</p><p><strong>2. Q: What is your company's available production capacity?</strong></p><p>A: 100,000 PER month.</p><p><strong>3. Q: What's your company's main product?</strong></p><p>A: Our company is specialized in submersible pumps, including submersible screw pump, submersible multistage pump and so on.</p><p><br/></p>\n</div>\n<p class=\"productsTags\"> Hot Tags: bore hole pump, China, suppliers, manufacturers, buy</p>\n<div class=\"ptit\">Related Products</div>\n<ul class=\"rollPro1\">\n<li>\n<div class=\"pbox\"><a href=\"/2-5-submersible-pump/2-5-inch-submersible-impeller-pump\"><img alt=\"2.5 Inch Submersible Impeller Pump\" border=\"0\" src=\"/uploads/201816806/small/2-5-inch-submersible-impeller-pump29176943256a77d.jpg?size=263x0\"/></a></div>\n<p><a href=\"/2-5-submersible-pump/2-5-inch-submersible-impeller-pump\">2.5 Inch Submersible Impeller Pump</a></p>\n</li><li>\n<div class=\"pbox\"><a href=\"/3-submersible-pump/3-peripheral-submersible-pump/vortex-impeller-submersible-pumps\"><img alt=\"Vortex Impeller Submersible Pumps\" border=\"0\" src=\"/uploads/201816806/small/vortex-impeller-submersible-pumps46326530815a77d.jpg?size=263x0\"/></a></div>\n<p><a href=\"/3-submersible-pump/3-peripheral-submersible-pump/vortex-impeller-submersible-pumps\">Vortex Impeller Submersible Pumps</a></p>\n</li><li>\n<div class=\"pbox\"><a href=\"/4-submersible-pump/100qjd-4-submersible-water-pump/submersible-well-pump\"><img alt=\"Submersible Well Pump\" border=\"0\" src=\"/uploads/201816806/small/submersible-well-pump28066731870a77d.jpg?size=263x0\"/></a></div>\n<p><a href=\"/4-submersible-pump/100qjd-4-submersible-water-pump/submersible-well-pump\">Submersible Well Pump</a></p>\n</li><li>\n<div class=\"pbox\"><a href=\"/4-submersible-pump/4